WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
<b>Sintel</b> — <i>Durian Open Movie Project (CC BY 3.0)</i>

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:25.000
<i>[Howling mountain wind across snowbound ridges]</i>

3
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:45.000
<b>Gatekeeper:</b> What brings you alone through the pass in this storm?

4
00:00:45.000 --> 00:01:30.000
<b>Sintel:</b> I'm searching for someone... <i>a fledgling dragon I called Scales.</i>

5
00:01:30.000 --> 00:03:00.000
<b>Shaman:</b> You have come far, child. Sit by the brazier and tell your story.

6
00:03:00.000 --> 00:05:30.000
<i>[Orchestral score swells as Sintel crosses the desert dunes]</i>

7
00:05:30.000 --> 00:06:15.000
<b>Sintel:</b> <i>Scales!</i> I crossed the Ashen Peaks to find you — don't be afraid.

8
00:06:15.000 --> 00:09:00.000
<b>Shaman:</b> Guard your heart in the cavern of the ancient guardian.

9
00:09:00.000 --> 00:14:48.000
<i>[Closing theme — Blender Institute Open Movie Project]</i>
